## 3. Stats and gear

**Stat priority:** Intellect > Versatility > Haste > Critical Strike > Mastery

- Versatility adds damage and also reduces damage taken.
- Haste shortens the GCD and makes DoTs tick faster.
- Use PvP gear wherever possible, since it gets a higher item level in PvP. Look for Versatility and Haste.

