## 6. Arena compositions

### 2v2
Always play with a healer. Affliction ramps up too slowly for double DPS. DoT both enemies, stay far away and kite. Avoid Mistweaver Monk, because Paralysis breaks on your DoTs.

| Partner |
|---|
| Discipline Priest |
| Preservation Evoker |
| Restoration Druid |

### 3v3
Play with another caster so you're not the only one getting interrupted. Burst when their interrupts are on cooldown.

| Comp | Partners |
|---|---|
| Shadowplay | Shadow Priest + Restoration Shaman |
| RLP | Outlaw Rogue + Discipline Priest |
| MLP | Frost Mage + Discipline Priest |
| LSP | Elemental Shaman + Holy Paladin |
| FLP | Feral Druid + Holy Paladin |
| WLS | Arms Warrior + Restoration Shaman |

